            <div xml:id="d425">

                <pb facs="0422" n="410" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg410"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 D 82/567: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-13T09:00:00+03:25">November 13,
                            1943—9 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 9:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1059. Referring to my telegram No. 1045, November 4, 9 a.m. I returned Tehran
                    yesterday from Marrakesh and resumed charge of the Legation today, This change
                    in my plans was made after consultation with Secretary Hull who suggested the
                    advisability of postponing my leave for a few weeks pending a more suitable
                    moment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
